Package: BouQuet
Title: Bouhaddou Lab Quantitative Proteomics Toolkit
Version: 4.0.0
Authors@R: person("Bouhaddou Lab", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "bouhaddoulab@gmail.com")
Description: Post-search analysis of Spectronaut DIA proteomics data (protein abundance,
    phosphorylation and ubiquitination): QC, MSstats quantification, pathway enrichment,
    kinase activity and PhosphoSitePlus regulatory sites. Comes with an R Markdown notebook
    template (File > New File > R Markdown > From Template > BouQuet).
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1),
    data.table,
    dplyr,
    ggplot2,
    ggcorrplot,
    patchwork,
    ComplexHeatmap,
    MSstats
Imports:
    circlize,
    clusterProfiler,
    ggrepel,
